{"data": [{"author_id": "1888184278808428546", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:54:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120304243353530845"], "id": "2120304243353530845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这个区分没问题。更值得问的是为什么误读会流行：卡的数量最好向董事会交差，新方法要烧完算力才知道能不能规模化，所以行业会系统性晚一步才承认架构创新。堆卡是放大器，选什么被放大，才是难判断。", "url": "https://x.com/lu_huanyu37749/status/2120304243353530845"}, {"author_id": "1345570459736129536", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:41:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120210208073158932"], "id": "2120210208073158932", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@NeoJubao @dotey 流程和上下文理顺了才算真换代，光换模型就是白折腾", "url": "https://x.com/WillsonMa1/status/2120210208073158932"}, {"author_id": "2119708369586208768", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:13:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120188047107190975"], "id": "2120188047107190975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 把《苦涩的教训》读成“只管堆卡”，跟把健身读成“只管吃蛋白粉”差不多😂", "url": "https://x.com/mikeYangtian/status/2120188047107190975"}, {"author_id": "3187068558", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:28:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120176802698309953"], "id": "2120176802698309953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 做 agent 时对这点感受很深：模型变强确实会抹平很多技巧，但上下文怎么给、工具怎么设计、结果怎么验证，这些不会被算力自动解决。《苦涩的教训》说的是别手工往里塞知识，不是说不需要工程。", "url": "https://x.com/aaronguostudio/status/2120176802698309953"}, {"author_id": "2078757475722076160", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:52:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120167752589808102"], "id": "2120167752589808102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 我给店铺agent写逐步SOP，页面一改版就全线崩；后来改成只给目标+护栏（价格下限、钱相关要审批），让它自己找路，完成率反而上去了。巧思没消失，只是从写步骤挪到了划边界。", "url": "https://x.com/HeadlineThtr/status/2120167752589808102"}, {"author_id": "955232320063090693", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:27:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120161548794843157"], "id": "2120161548794843157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这个误读对芯片需求很关键：如果教训是“只要堆算力”，那芯片需求就是一条直线；但原文说的是搜索和学习这类能随算力扩展的通用方法，算法效率仍然决定算力能转化成多少能力。你觉得下一代模型是算力瓶颈先到，还是算法瓶颈先到？", "url": "https://x.com/TheEaglegon/status/2120161548794843157"}, {"author_id": "2095161146504515584", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:09:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120156843934929002"], "id": "2120156843934929002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 不能只堆算力", "url": "https://x.com/maytmku/status/2120156843934929002"}, {"author_id": "1935366812218310659", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:56:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120153697720442921"], "id": "2120153697720442921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 落到干活上其实挺明显。模型换代确实帮大忙，但真跳一截，往往是把流程和上下文重新理过之后，光换更强的模型不够", "url": "https://x.com/NeoJubao/status/2120153697720442921"}, {"author_id": "1998230620615671808", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:37:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120133772448555092"], "id": "2120133772448555092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 确实，光会无脑堆卡没用，架构要是跟不上分分钟给你训崩掉", "url": "https://x.com/Hsanli_x/status/2120133772448555092"}, {"author_id": "1483356467176820738", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:07:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120126318503481800"], "id": "2120126318503481800", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 模型的迭代进化需要clever new methods来指导", "url": "https://x.com/xxx10951859/status/2120126318503481800"}, {"author_id": "1878373184740937728", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:03:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120125156915818888"], "id": "2120125156915818888", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey (⊙Д⊙)", "url": "https://x.com/KandaoMaster/status/2120125156915818888"}, {"author_id": "1519503815598346241", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:55:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120108029005996039"], "id": "2120108029005996039", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey “堆算力就够了”是对过去的总结，不一定是对未来的预言。算力在变贵，数据快见底，方法论迟早要回来。", "url": "https://x.com/mengdi20/status/2120108029005996039"}, {"author_id": "2100051620436537345", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:29:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120101500496363587"], "id": "2120101500496363587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 现在有个挺有意思的现象：一个观点只要足够有名，慢慢就没人看原文了，大家都开始饮用别人对它的解释\n感觉ai圈也逃不过这个规律🤓", "url": "https://x.com/answer007s/status/2120101500496363587"}, {"author_id": "923077807793516544", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120097439713804498"], "id": "2120097439713804498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 把《苦涩的教训》读成唯算力论，恰好忽略了另一半：Transformer 本身就是精巧创新，而当下真正稀缺的不是显卡，是还没人想到的那步架构改动。", "url": "https://x.com/luyun0120/status/2120097439713804498"}, {"author_id": "843852184403898368", "conversation_id": "2120039846118821976", "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:06:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120095867076292801"], "id": "2120095867076292801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 补充一点：原文反对的是把人类经验写死进模型，这和“算法不重要”是两回事，后者更像是被市场叙事带偏的读法。", "url": "https://x.com/RwatitFahsa/status/2120095867076292801"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1888184278808428546", "name": "不忽悠的柜员", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 1849, "following_count": 2589, "like_count": 136, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 39, "tweet_count": 2377}, "username": "lu_huanyu37749"}, {"id": "1345570459736129536", "name": "Mr马总｜代举报｜", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 8802, "following_count": 3841, "like_count": 537, "listed_count": 24, "media_count": 208, "tweet_count": 28467}, "username": "WillsonMa1"}, {"id": "2119708369586208768", "name": "仰天", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 39, "following_count": 39, "like_count": 3, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 4, "tweet_count": 34}, "username": "mikeYangtian"}, {"id": "3187068558", "name": "Aaron Guo", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 114, "following_count": 1787, "like_count": 4262, "listed_count": 1, "media_count": 48, "tweet_count": 272}, "username": "aaronguostudio"}, {"id": "2078757475722076160", "name": "Headline Theater", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 9, "following_count": 98, "like_count": 11, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 11, "tweet_count": 88}, "username": "HeadlineThtr"}, {"id": "955232320063090693", "name": "Eaglegon | AI × Chips", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 797, "following_count": 1900, "like_count": 3345, "listed_count": 6, "media_count": 582, "tweet_count": 7605}, "username": "TheEaglegon"}, {"id": "2095161146504515584", "name": "KKKKeF（诚信互关）", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 984, "following_count": 1075, "like_count": 446, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 22, "tweet_count": 1726}, "username": "maytmku"}, {"id": "1935366812218310659", "name": "Neo｜AI 创业", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 54, "following_count": 81, "like_count": 1, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 9, "tweet_count": 115}, "username": "NeoJubao"}, {"id": "1998230620615671808", "name": "Hsanli", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 71, "following_count": 36, "like_count": 46, "listed_count": 2, "media_count": 46, "tweet_count": 181}, "username": "Hsanli_x"}, {"id": "1483356467176820738", "name": "HonLam", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 3, "following_count": 230, "like_count": 229, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 0, "tweet_count": 18}, "username": "xxx10951859"}, {"id": "1878373184740937728", "name": "强壮的砍刀", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 929, "following_count": 777, "like_count": 4516, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 327, "tweet_count": 6595}, "username": "KandaoMaster"}, {"id": "1519503815598346241", "name": "日子有旁白", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 527, "following_count": 512, "like_count": 484, "listed_count": 2, "media_count": 136, "tweet_count": 1009}, "username": "mengdi20"}, {"id": "2100051620436537345", "name": "阿翔在开工", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 182, "following_count": 204, "like_count": 15, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 4, "tweet_count": 145}, "username": "answer007s"}, {"id": "923077807793516544", "name": "未知", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 2450, "following_count": 2627, "like_count": 672, "listed_count": 4, "media_count": 64, "tweet_count": 15098}, "username": "luyun0120"}, {"id": "843852184403898368", "name": "RwatitFahsa", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 6047, "following_count": 7356, "like_count": 4711, "listed_count": 4, "media_count": 304, "tweet_count": 7945}, "username": "RwatitFahsa"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2120304243353530845", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovbxw2h059oe2ouusci5o7vycu5", "oldest_id": "2120095867076292801", "result_count": 15}}